  "summary": {
    "I01": "Preserved manager mechanical fixes in academics-lifecycle.integration.test.ts and auth-and-sessions.integration.test.ts, and added post-GRANT login recovery (200 OK) verification in AUTH-IT-16.",
    "I02": "Preserved manager setClauseSql fix in GradesService.submitLessonGrades and added isolated ACAD-IT-11 test covering multi-item batch rollback on 2nd item failure, concurrent grade update conflict (409), idempotency payload mismatch (409), and append-only audit_logs revisions.",
    "I03": "Added authorizeBeforeReplayOrExecute hook in executeIdempotentOperation and 2-statement post-lock live entitlement verification in AcademicAccessService.assertLessonAccess so revoked/reassigned substitutes and reassigned primary teachers fail closed with 403 FORBIDDEN_OBJECT_SCOPE before any cached client_operation_logs replay is returned, while authorized replays still return 200 OK (ACAD-UNIT-05, ACAD-IT-12).",
    "I04": "Created shared authoritative tariff resolver (apps/api/src/academics/price-resolver.ts) and wired it across GroupsService, CoursesService, GroupsController (?as_of_date=), and AcademicAccessService so future group-specific and course tariffs take effect automatically on effective_from in the center/group timezone without leaking across groups or mutating historical invoices (ACAD-UNIT-04, ACAD-IT-13).",
    "I05": "Preserved DB-IT-19 independent transaction fix, CI job/gate timeout bounds in infra/ci/eduerp-ci.yml, and untouched package-lock.json.",
    "I06": "Added independent failure-mode unit tests (ACAD-UNIT-04, ACAD-UNIT-05) and HTTP/PostgreSQL integration tests (ACAD-IT-11, ACAD-IT-12, ACAD-IT-13) and created docs/verification/S07-J.md."
  },
